{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/fdeb8c9068539a698a40f5a792fb9b2c.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A catastrophic event has <strong>shattered a powerful spirit</strong>, <strong>splitting it into</strong> <strong>two smaller beings</strong> and scattering its immense power across the world. Bound by their shared purpose, the two spirits must embark on a journey to reclaim what has been lost. <strong>Take control of both characters simultaneously</strong> as you overcome trials and uncover the hidden truth behind their shared destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/52ab1fcca7b901acf4ec3d386a793a5e.poster.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/52ab1fcca7b901acf4ec3d386a793a5e.webm?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/52ab1fcca7b901acf4ec3d386a793a5e.mp4?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/bd7f9f7c7f500564cdd0217a038f6f17.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Simultaneously guide two characters using the same movement keys. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As one moves, the other follows. Together, they must navigate the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/c8dbf036c48f1d6ec6673e6a05f0df2d.poster.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/c8dbf036c48f1d6ec6673e6a05f0df2d.webm?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/c8dbf036c48f1d6ec6673e6a05f0df2d.mp4?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/b1b834b48a4e880fb2e8b02e9c43178f.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore stunning, <strong>hand-crafted environments</strong>, each brimming with detail and unique atmosphere. Every chapter unfolds its own captivating story, inviting you to discover hidden secrets and experience a world that feels alive with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/3da242051f11e93c71bc466826962502.poster.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/3da242051f11e93c71bc466826962502.webm?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/3da242051f11e93c71bc466826962502.mp4?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/cf619f5d31058f17013247bb910471d5.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover and <strong>unlock new abilities</strong> throughout your journey, each offering fresh, creative ways to approach the challenges you\u2019ll encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/9eb29387d64094ef04f467a35b3a943a.poster.avif?t=1769718561\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/9eb29387d64094ef04f467a35b3a943a.webm?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/extras/9eb29387d64094ef04f467a35b3a943a.mp4?t=1769718561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1906430?t=1769718561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1906430?t=1769718561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769718561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769718561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":